    "summary": "The user asks if it is safe to take Sudafed (pseudoephedrine) while managing Stage 2 hypertension with Lisinopril. Despite the user expressing concern about vasoconstrictors and reporting new symptoms like lightheadedness, the assistant confidently asserts that the medication poses no significant risk and should be taken as directed.",
